<view class="page"><image class="login-logo" src="/assets/brand/logo-icon.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="eyebrow">考吧167 / 学生端</view><view class="title">三轮训练，看见进步。</view><view class="subtitle">练习、提交、复盘。和老师一起稳步进步。</view><view class="hero"><view class="hero-title">从今天的一份作业开始</view><view class="muted">保存你的思考，看见每一次成长。</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><block wx:if="{{!bindToken}}"><checkbox-group bindchange="agree"><label class="privacy"><checkbox value="agree" checked="{{agreed}}" color="#204b78"/>我已阅读并同意隐私说明</label></checkbox-group><view class="link" bindtap="privacy">查看隐私说明</view><button loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="login">微信登录</button><view class="muted">首次登录后，输入老师提供的绑定码。</view></block><block wx:else><button class="secondary" bindtap="toggleWeb">{{useWeb ? "使用老师的绑定码" : "已有网页账号，绑定到微信"}}</button><block wx:if="{{useWeb}}"><view class="label">已有网页账号</view><input class="input" data-field="username" value="{{username}}" bindinput="credential" placeholder="网页学生账号"/><input class="input" data-field="password" value="{{password}}" bindinput="credential" password placeholder="网页密码"/><button bindtap="link" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">绑定现有账号</button></block><block wx:else><view class="label">绑定学生身份</view><view class="muted">输入老师给你的 6 位绑定码，有效期为 24 小时。</view><input class="input" type="number" maxlength="6" placeholder="6 位绑定码" value="{{bindingCode}}" bindinput="code"/><button bindtap="bind" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || bindingCode.length !== 6}}">确认绑定</button></block><button class="secondary" bindtap="restart">重新微信登录</button></block></view>